# Everything under .claude is local state, except the iflow skill, which is part
# of the framework and must travel with it. BMAD's skills stay local.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/iflow/

_bmad/
_bmad-output/
.DS_Store

__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The framework is what is versioned here. Changes carried through it are the
# output of using it on one estate, not part of it — every adopter has their
# own, and nothing in the method requires this folder name.
changes/

# The author's own notes, which are not documentation of the framework and do
# not belong under a share-alike licence.
docs/links.md

# How we intend to develop the framework is our working state, not the
# framework. Nobody adopting it needs our intentions, and a list of them in
# the repository is a second copy of what the escalation ledger already
# computes from the changes in flight.
BACKLOG.md

# Derived state, rebuilt from the code whenever the code moves.
.estate/
